$ engramdb --no-maintenance --dir [PROJECT] harvest ledger prune --older-than 0d
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
Error: invalid --older-than value '0d': 0 would evict every transcript copy at once. To drop every unpinned copy on purpose, use `--max-bytes 1 --apply` (0 means no size limit); pinned copies need `harvest ledger rm <id> --unpin`.
